    "text": "<p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sgn</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Let <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/c9d7aeb1-bd92-4103-87e6-d056899c6428.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:3.06042in;height:1.16667in\" /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>